1. Acacia Mining

这一页三家股东都建议介绍，因为均不是全球广为人知的矿业集团。

Akfen Holding
Turkish infrastructure investment holding with activities across energy, ports, transportation, real estate, tourism and mining

İlbak Madencilik
Mining arm of İlbak Holding, a Turkish diversified group active across mining, media, marketing communications, tourism and real estate

Bacacı Yatırım Holding
Turkish diversified investment group with businesses spanning logistics, energy and mining; joined Acacia’s shareholder base through BMA Madencilik in 2022

Acacia当前股权为Akfen Holding 42.5%、İlbak Madencilik 42.5%及BMA Madencilik／Bacacı Yatırım Holding 15.0%；三家分别于2016年、2011年和2022年加入股东结构。

