3. Anglo American Sur

这一页最需要解释的是 Inversiones Mineras Becrux，而不是重复介绍Anglo American。

Anglo American
Global mining company focused on copper, premium iron ore and crop nutrients; controlling shareholder of Anglo American Sur

Inversiones Mineras Becrux
Codelco–Mitsui joint venture investment vehicle holding 29.5% of Anglo American Sur

下面缩进两行：

* Codelco — 67.8%: Chilean state-owned copper producer
* Mitsui — 32.2%: Japanese diversified global trading and investment company

Mitsubishi Corporation
Japanese global integrated business enterprise with investments and operations across multiple industries

AAS由Anglo American持有50.1%、Mitsubishi持有20.4%，Becrux持有29.5%；Becrux内部由Codelco持有67.8%、Mitsui持有32.2%，因此Codelco在AAS的有效权益约为20.0%。

Slide上可以排成

Anglo American — 50.1%
Global mining company and controlling shareholder

Inversiones Mineras Becrux — 29.5%
Codelco–Mitsui joint venture

* Codelco: 67.8%
* Mitsui: 32.2%

Mitsubishi Corporation — 20.4%
Japanese global integrated business enterprise

这样比现在只把股比再抄一遍更有价值。

