4. Quebrada Blanca

这里需要区分两家名称相似的Sumitomo公司，并突出Codelco不承担capex。

Teck — 60%
Canadian resource company focused on copper and zinc; controlling shareholder of Quebrada Blanca

Sumitomo Metal Mining — 25%
Japanese non-ferrous metals company engaged in mining, smelting and refining, and advanced materials

Sumitomo Corporation — 5%
Japanese integrated trading and business investment company with a global operating network

Codelco — 10%
Chilean state-owned copper producer holding a non-funding preference share interest

Teck持有QB 60%，Sumitomo Metal Mining及Sumitomo Corporation合计持有30%，Codelco持有10%的non-funding interest；资本开支由Teck和两家Sumitomo股东按比例承担
